This is the PET-MAD v1.0.2 model
================================

A universal interatomic potential for advanced materials modeling

Model authors
-------------

- Arslan Mazitov (arslan.mazitov@epfl.ch)
- Filippo Bigi
- Matthias Kellner
- Paolo Pegolo
- Davide Tisi
- Guillaume Fraux
- Sergey Pozdnyakov
- Philip Loche
- Michele Ceriotti (michele.ceriotti@epfl.ch)

Model references
----------------

Please cite the following references when using this model:
- about this specific model:
  * http://arxiv.org/abs/2503.14118
- about the architecture of this model:
  * LLPR (uncertainty method):
    https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/2632-2153/ad805f
  * LPR (if using per-atom uncertainty):
    https://pubs.acs.org/doi/10.1021/acs.jctc.3c00704
  * https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.19302v3

WARNING: the model declared support for unknown device 'cuda', it will be ignored (src/ML-METATOMIC/pair_metatomic.cpp:216)
Running simulation on cpu device with float32 data
pair_coeff * * 28 26 24
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 check yes
min_style cg
min_modify dmax ${dmax} line quadratic
min_modify dmax 0.01 line quadratic
thermo 1
thermo_style custom step temp pe press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz lx ly lz vol
thermo_modify norm no

variable delta equal ${up}*${len0}
variable delta equal 6e-06*${len0}
variable delta equal 6e-06*17.2413972351837
variable deltaxy equal ${up}*xy
variable deltaxy equal 6e-06*xy
variable deltaxz equal ${up}*xz
variable deltaxz equal 6e-06*xz
variable deltayz equal ${up}*yz
variable deltayz equal 6e-06*yz
if "${dir} == 1" then "change_box all x delta 0 ${delta} xy delta ${deltaxy} xz delta ${deltaxz} remap units box"
if "${dir} == 2" then "change_box all y delta 0 ${delta} yz delta ${deltayz} remap units box"
if "${dir} == 3" then "change_box all z delta 0 ${delta} remap units box"
change_box all z delta 0 ${delta} remap units box
change_box all z delta 0 0.000103448383411102 remap units box
Changing box ...
  triclinic box = (0.00041885514 -0.0022082202 0.0018008824) to (17.24458 17.247207 17.243302) with tilt (1.0562221e-15 1.0557311e-15 1.0557311e-15)
if "${dir} == 4" then "change_box all yz delta ${delta} remap units box"
if "${dir} == 5" then "change_box all xz delta ${delta} remap units box"
if "${dir} == 6" then "change_box all xy delta ${delta} remap units box"

minimize ${etol} ${ftol} ${maxiter} ${maxeval}
minimize 1e-08 ${ftol} ${maxiter} ${maxeval}
minimize 1e-08 1e-12 ${maxiter} ${maxeval}
minimize 1e-08 1e-12 0 ${maxeval}
minimize 1e-08 1e-12 0 50000
